ocumento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o e comprovativo oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e tempos cronometrados por chip eletr\u00f3nico da Corrida de 10 km e Estafeta ficam dispon\u00edveis imediatamente ap\u00f3s o t\u00e9rmino do evento atrav\u00e9s da plataforma de resultados da Xistarca e no portal Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67720,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51593","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-keil-do-amaral-monsanto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-corrida-100-anos-ordem-dos-advogados-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51593","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51593"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51593\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":67728,"href":"h